[h1]Ukrainian Localization for Starship Troopers: Terran Command[/h1]
Unofficial Ukrainian translation: UI, units, abilities, technologies, achievements, mission briefings and objectives. Game version: [b]v6.5.0[/b].

[h2]Installation[/h2]
[olist]
[*]Download the latest release archive: [url=https://github.com/UKA-Localization/Starship-Troopers-Terran-Command-localization-uk-UA/releases]GitHub Releases[/url].
[*]Extract it into the game folder so that the files land in
[code]<game folder>\Starship Troopers_Data\StreamingAssets\[/code]
(by default [code]C:\Program Files (x86)\Steam\steamapps\common\Starship Troopers - Terran Command\Starship Troopers_Data\StreamingAssets\[/code]). [b]Language\languages.txt[/b] gets replaced — that is expected: it has the Ukrainian entry added.
[*]Launch the game: [b]Options → Language → Українська[/b], then restart the game.
[/olist]

[h2]Uninstall[/h2]
Delete [b]Language\ukrainian*.csv[/b] and [b]Scenarios\*\text_ukrainian.csv[/b], then restore the original [b]languages.txt[/b] (Steam → Properties → Installed Files → Verify integrity).

[h2]Known issues[/h2]
[list]
[*]A game update may restore the original languages.txt, so Ukrainian disappears from the list. Extract the archive again.
[*]The language flag icon next to "Українська" may be missing — the icons are baked into the game assets.
[/list]

